Academic attribution

This visualization is grounded in W. A. Hassan, Validating Legal Compliance —
Governance Analysis Method (University of Ottawa, 2009), and the GAM 2.0 formal
engine and its corrections (polarity split, shared vocabulary, and closure
semantics). Preserve this attribution in copies of this documentation and cite
these foundations in academic use. This attribution request adds no restriction
to the MIT permission above. It does not relicense the dissertation or imply
endorsement by its author or the University of Ottawa.

